mation\"></span>\r\n            </a>\r\n            <h1 className=\"video-title mx-auto\">\r\n                {title}\r\n            </h1>\r\n        </>\r\n    )\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nconst Courses = (props) => {\r\n    const router = useRouter();\r\n    let [isPurchased, setIsPurchased] = useState(null);\r\n\r\n    if (!props.courseLesson) {\r\n        return (<div></div>)\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    useEffect(async () => {\r\n        if (props.courseLesson.price == 0 || props.courseLesson.coursePrice == 0) {\r\n            setIsPurchased(true);\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            var userId = getUserid();\r\n            if (userId) {\r\n                var orderHistory = await getUserOrderHistory(userId);\r\n                setIsPurchased(orderHistory?.courseLessonIds.some(q => q == courseLesson.id) || orderHistory?.courseIds.some(q => q == props.courseLesson?.courseId))\r\n            } else {\r\n                router.push(\"/auth\")\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    }, [props.courseLesson]);\r\n\r\n    const breadCrumbConfig = [\r\n        {\r\n            title: props.courseLesson?.courseTitle,\r\n            link: `/courses/${props.courseLesson?.courseId}`\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            title: props.courseLesson?.title,\r\n            link: `/courses/${props.courseLesson?.courseId}/${props.courseLesson?.id}`\r\n        }\r\n    ];\r\n    // if (isPurchased == null) {\r\n\r\n    //     return null;\r\n    // }\r\n    if (isPurchased == false) {\r\n        router.push(\"/\")\r\n    }\r\n    return (\r\n        <>\r\n            <Head>\r\n                <title>{props.courseLesson.title}</title>\r\n                <meta name=\"description\" content={`${props.courseLesson.abstract}`} />\r\n            </Head>\r\n            <CourseLayout syllabus={true} teacherConfig={props.relatedTeacher} breadCrumbConfig={breadCrumbConfig}>\r\n                <div className=\"container\">\r\n\r\n                    <div className=\"row\">\r\n                        <div className=\"col-12 text-center\">\r\n                            <div className=\"aspect-ratio-box\">\r\n                                <div className=\"aspect-ratio-box-inside\">\r\n                                    <ReactPlayer light={`https://repo.logonomy.ir/Files/CourseLesson/Thumbnail/${props.courseLesson.medias[0]?.rowId}/${props.courseLesson.medias[0]?.fileName}`} playIcon={<PlayIcon title={props.courseLesson.title} />} width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" controls={true} url={props.courseLesson.medias.find(q => q.mediaType == \"Video\") != null ? `https://repo.logonomy.ir/Files/CourseLesson/Video/${props.courseLesson.medias[props.courseLesson.medias.findIndex(q => q.mediaType == \"Video\")]?.rowId}/${props.courseLesson.medias[props.courseLesson.medias.findIndex(q => q.mediaType == \"Video\")]?.fileName}` : 'https://devtube.arvanvod.com/D24bolgPaq/Edg3E538oM/origin_tx25MAVlGQ7Xv8risi7OTCpiVzgqcuEzdRMwvTge.mp4'} />\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            {props.courseLesson.medias.some(q => q.mediaType == \"Attachment\") && <a download href={`https://repo.logonomy.ir/Files/CourseLesson/Attachment/${props.courseLesson.medias[props.courseLesson.medias.findIndex(q => q.mediaType == \"Attachment\")]?.rowId}/${props.courseLesson.medias[props.courseLesson.medias.findIndex(q => q.mediaType == \"Attachment\")]?.fileName}`} className=\"cs-btn-one btn-gradient-color text-white mx-auto btn-sm mt-2\">دانلود  فایل پیوست</a>}\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div className=\"col-md-12 col-lg-12 col-xl-12 mt-2\">\r\n                            <div className=\"entry-content single-news-content\">\r\n                                <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: transformHref(props.courseLesson.description) }} className=\"\"></div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </CourseLayout>\r\n        </>\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nexport async function getStaticPaths() {\r\n    const res = await getCourseLessons();\r\n    const paths = res.items.map((lesson) => ({\r\n        params: { courseSlug: `${lesson.courseId}`, lessonSlug: `${lesson.id}` },\r\n    }))\r\n\r\n    return { paths, fallback: true }\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport async function getStaticProps({ params }) {\r\n    var courseLesson = await getSingleCourseLesson(params.lessonSlug);\r\n    var relatedTeacher = await getSingleTeacher(courseLesson.courseTeacherId);\r\n    return {\r\n        props: {\r\n            courseLesson: courseLesson,\r\n            relatedTeacher\r\n        },\r\n        revalidate: 100\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport default Courses;"]},"metadata":{},"sourceType":"module"}